      915         get-fbr-obj-name(buf_fbr-prn-grp.db-num, buf_fbr-prn-grp.prn-num) COLUMN-LABEL "Принтер!установлен" FORMAT "X(11)":U
      916               WIDTH 12
      917         get-grp-name(buf_fbr-prn-grp.node-code) COLUMN-LABEL "Группа" FORMAT "X(65)":U
      918         buf_fbr-prn-grp.obj-type + string(buf_fbr-prn-grp.obj-code) COLUMN-LABEL "Объект!товара" FORMAT "X(8)":U
      919       WITH NO-ROW-MARKERS SEPARATORS SIZE 98 BY 19.13.
      920   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
      921        B-exit AT ROW 1 COL 1
      922        B-add AT ROW 1 COL 21
      923        B-delete AT ROW 1 COL 31
      924        B-chg AT ROW 1 COL 41
      925        B-print AT ROW 1 COL 61
      926        B-help AT ROW 1 COL 71
      927        BR-prn-grp AT ROW 2.5 COL 1
      928        SPACE(0.24) SKIP(0.40)
      929       WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
      930            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D  SCROLLABLE
      931            TITLE "Группы товаров на принтере кухни"
      932            DEFAULT-BUTTON B-exit.
      933   ASSIGN
      934          FRAME Dialog-Frame:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE
      935          FRAME Dialog-Frame:HIDDEN           = TRUE.
      936   ON WINDOW-CLOSE OF FRAME Dialog-Frame
      937   DO:
